## Why This Is Asked
Tests end-to-end CV design with 3D reconstruction, uncertainty, and fast on-device adaptation, crucial for tool manipulation in cluttered spaces.

## Key Concepts
- 3D pose + mesh prediction from monocular input
- Uncertainty estimation and active adaptation
- Edge-efficient architectures and losses for consistency

## Code Example
